ich is 8 tens).\n\n4. Now, we add the two partial products together:\n   ```\n   325\n+ 5200\n------\n  5525\n   ```\n\nTherefore, the product of 65 and 85 is 5525.\n<\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>5525</\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>\n</answer>",
